A||N||54||87ECO5||2001 PFF Calendar - LAST CHAPTER!!!!!||||14||
Z||000000||87ECO5||12-05-2000||09:49 AM||||WOW!  I can't believe how trusting everyone is on this forum!  Many of you just sent me your hard-earned money - without question or any kind of proof that you'd actually receive a product!  Well, there's a lesson here.  So far, I've collected enough money to purchase everything needed to completely restore my suspension AND interior!  What about the calendars, you ask?  I don't care - make your own!!!!!<P>Ha ha ha ha ha … just kidding!!!!!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>In all seriousness … the first round of 2001 PFF calendars was shipped today!  Those on the list of recipients include (the PFF usernames are followed by the number of calendars shipped):<P>2xsess (1)<BR>Bill Osmer (1)<BR>ChadMan (2)<BR>Cheever2 (1)<BR>Cliff Pennock (1)<BR>count_iblis (2)<BR>DaRkLoRD (1)<BR>DJRice (2)<BR>DrRodey (1)<BR>Haze_Performance (2)<BR>jammer (1)<BR>jimig (2)<BR>Kevin-84SE (1)<BR>Master_Sushi (1)<BR>MooCow (1)<BR>NDFieroTN (3)<BR>onfire (2)<BR>Oreif (2)<BR>PatrickB (1)<BR>ponya (1)<BR>RiceCooker (2)<BR>Rob S (1)<BR>Robert (1)<BR>SAGE (2)<BR>Seanh (1)<BR>SloPonti (1)<BR>sluppy123 (1)<BR>StuGood (1)<BR>TheFiero64 (2)<P>First and foremost, please contact one of us if you see a problem (i.e. you sent your money more than a few days ago but are not on the list, you sent money for a certain number of calendars but the list shows you're not receiving that many, etc.).  If there is a problem, we want to get it corrected IMMEDIATELY!<P>Lisa and I will use this thread to periodically post a status on shipments.  As you send your money, check this thread to determine when we shipped your calendar.<P>Once again, Lisa and I would like to thank EVERYONE for their interest in the calendar.  A special "thank you" goes out to Cliff for giving us the venue with which to accomplish this.<P>Thank you ...<P>Lisa and Scott Haas (   <A HREF="mailto:FieroWife@aol.com">FieroWife@aol.com</A>    and    <A HREF="mailto:Fiero87EC5@aol.com">Fiero87EC5@aol.com</A>   )<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 12-05-2000).]||||reg||14
