Z||000006||Haze_Performance||12-05-2000||06:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 87ECO5:<BR><B>WOW!  I can't believe how trusting everyone is on this forum!  Many of you just sent me your hard-earned money - without question or any kind of proof that you'd actually receive a product!  Well, there's a lesson here.  So far, I've collected enough money to purchase everything needed to completely restore my suspension AND interior!  What about the calendars, you ask?  I don't care - make your own!!!!!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I guess if it was true we could all come to the town where we sent our money and burn it to the ground. hehe lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlogo1_1.gif">    <BR><B>"AHHHHH!!! All Fiero's don't start on fire you BONEHEAD!!"</B>||||reg||11
