Z||000009||87ECO5||12-05-2000||09:19 PM||||There have been several threads started for this project (7 to be exact).  Thought I'd try to link everything together in this latest thread.<P>The first three threads were used to get a feel for interest and to assist in the development of the calendar's cover:<P><B>PFF Calendar 2001 - </B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003883.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003883.html</A> <BR><B>PFF Calendar 2001 (continued) - </B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003931.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003931.html</A> <BR><B>2001 PFF Calendar... - </B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004175.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004175.html</A> <P>The fourth thread outlines final pricing for the product:<P><B>PFF Calendar 2001 (price and taking orders) - </B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004201.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004201.html</A> <P>The fifth thread shows what the calendar looks like and provides important information like where to send money:<P><B>PFF Calendar 2001 (preview and ready for print!) - </B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004432.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004432.html</A> <P>Finally, the sixth thread explains why we got a late start on shipping:<P><B>PFF Calendar 2001 - update - </B> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004561.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004561.html</A> <P>I've received sooooooo many "thread replies" and emails from people asking many different questions but I'm not sure if I've answered them all.  If you have a question that hasn't been answered, please accept my apology and send me your question again.  I'll make sure it gets answered.<P>Also, I've received several notes from people asking if there are "extra" calendars.  To be perfectly honest, the initial list I created was simply made to give me a ballpark figure.  Lisa and I have the capability to run as many as necessary.  So, don't worry if you didn't make a list.  Just send me your money and I'll make sure you get a calendar A.S.A.P!<P>Finally, <B>please be sure to include your PFF username and a shipping address</B> with your payment - thank you!<P>Again, thank you for your support ...<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 12-05-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000010||87ECO5||12-05-2000||09:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by sqoach:<BR><B>dude, where's my name on that list??? i sent the check on friday.  what's up??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>sqoach: I have not received your payment yet (mail is sometimes slow here).  As soon as I do, I'll have your calendars on their way.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 12-05-2000).]||||reg||1
