Z||000042||87ECO5||12-15-2000||01:28 PM||||To give everyone a little information ... we received requests for 140 calendars:<P>- 76 have already been shipped<BR>- 4 will be hand-delivered tomorrow<BR>- "checks are in the mail" for 6 (if I counted your emails and posts correctly)<P>That makes 86 calendars "spoken for" and 54 still waiting to find homes.<P>So, here's what we're going to do.  We'll give the "owners" of those 54 calendars until midnight, Friday, January 5th to have their payment sent to us (that's exactly one month from the time they were made available for shipment).  Any calendar still unclaimed after that date will be put up for adoption (here first, then the Fiero clubs to which Lisa and I belong, then the Fiero List, then Ebay).<P>If, for some reason, you feel this is unreasonable, feel free to email me privately and we can discuss it.<P>Once again, Lisa and I thank you.||||reg||1
